<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>LLM</title><link>https://jaehun.me/tags/llm/</link><description>딥러닝 컴파일러 엔지니어 류재훈의 기술 블로그. LLM 추론 최적화, KV 캐시, 컴파일러, C++와 AI 논문·오픈소스 코드 분석을 정리합니다.</description><language>ko-kr</language><atom:link href="https://jaehun.me/tags/llm/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Code I/O: Condensing Reasoning Patterns via Code Input-Output Prediction</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/code-i/o-condensing-reasoning-patterns-via-code-input-output-prediction/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/code-i/o-condensing-reasoning-patterns-via-code-input-output-prediction/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Jul 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.07316v4"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="code-io-코드-입출력--자연어-cot로-범용-추론까지데이터-설계만으로-7b-30b-llm을-평균-2-점-끌어올리다"&gt;CODE I/O: 코드 입·출력 + 자연어 CoT로 범용 추론까지 — 데이터 설계만으로 7B-30B LLM을 평균 +2 점 끌어올리다&lt;a href="#code-io-%ec%bd%94%eb%93%9c-%ec%9e%85%ec%b6%9c%eb%a0%a5--%ec%9e%90%ec%97%b0%ec%96%b4-cot%eb%a1%9c-%eb%b2%94%ec%9a%a9-%ec%b6%94%eb%a1%a0%ea%b9%8c%ec%a7%80%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0-%ec%84%a4%ea%b3%84%eb%a7%8c%ec%9c%bc%eb%a1%9c-7b-30b-llm%ec%9d%84-%ed%8f%89%ea%b7%a0-2-%ec%a0%90-%eb%81%8c%ec%96%b4%ec%98%ac%eb%a6%ac%eb%8b%a4" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="tldr"&gt;TL;DR&lt;a href="#tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;“코드 함수 → 입력·출력 예측 + 체계적 Chain-of-Thought(CoT)”라는 단일 데이터 파이프라인만으로, 3.5 M 샘플이 14 M 규모 SOTA 데이터보다 더 크고 균형 잡힌 이득(+2.9 점)을 만든다.&lt;/strong&gt;&#10;검증 가능·저비용·다양성 세 마리 토끼를 잡은 &lt;strong&gt;CODE I/O&lt;/strong&gt;는 “데이터 품질 &amp;gt; 데이터 양”이라는 사실을 실험적으로 증명한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>KVzip: Query-Agnostic KV Cache Compression with Context Reconstruction</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/kvzip-query-agnostic-kv-cache-compression-with-context-reconstruction/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/kvzip-query-agnostic-kv-cache-compression-with-context-reconstruction/</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.23416v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="tldr"&gt;⚡️TL;DR&lt;a href="#tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KVzip&lt;/strong&gt;는 LLM의 KV 캐시를 &lt;em&gt;한 번&lt;/em&gt; 압축해도 이후 모든 질의 · 세션에서 재사용할 수 있도록 설계된 &lt;strong&gt;query-agnostic 캐시 컴프레서&lt;/strong&gt;다.&#10;그 결과 &lt;strong&gt;정확도 손실 ≤ 3 pp&lt;/strong&gt;를 유지하면서 &lt;strong&gt;레이턴시 2 × ↓, 메모리 60–394 × ↓&lt;/strong&gt;를 동시에 달성한다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Compress, Gather, and Recompute: REFORMingLong-Context Processing in Transformers</title><link>https://jaehun.me/posts/compress-gather-and-recompute-reforminglong-context-processing-in-transformers/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://jaehun.me/posts/compress-gather-and-recompute-reforminglong-context-processing-in-transformers/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0900</pubDate><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#10; href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.01215v1"target="_blank"&#10; class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"&#10; &gt;논문 링크&lt;svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0" id="external-link" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"&gt;&lt;path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 3h6v6m-11 5L21 3m-3 10v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="-reform-100만-토큰도-잊지-않는-llm-추론-파이프라인"&gt;⚡️ REFORM: 100만 토큰도 잊지 않는 LLM 추론 파이프라인&lt;a href="#-reform-100%eb%a7%8c-%ed%86%a0%ed%81%b0%eb%8f%84-%ec%9e%8a%ec%a7%80-%ec%95%8a%eb%8a%94-llm-%ec%b6%94%eb%a1%a0-%ed%8c%8c%ec%9d%b4%ed%94%84%eb%9d%bc%ec%9d%b8" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 id="한-줄-요약-tldr"&gt;한 줄 요약 (TL;DR)&lt;a href="#%ed%95%9c-%ec%a4%84-%ec%9a%94%ec%95%bd-tldr" class="heading-anchor" aria-label="이 섹션에 대한 링크"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REFORM&lt;/strong&gt;은 &lt;em&gt;압축(Compress) → 선별(Gather) → 선택적 재계산(Recompute)&lt;/em&gt; 세 단계를 하나로 묶어,&lt;br&gt;&#10;단일 H100 GPU에서도 &lt;strong&gt;100 만 토큰&lt;/strong&gt; 문맥을 &lt;em&gt;망각 없이&lt;/em&gt; 다루고 &lt;strong&gt;추론 지연·메모리&lt;/strong&gt;까지 줄여 준다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>